      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hey~! Hi human~ This is Mr. Dolangmal. kakaka~",
      "translation" : "嘿~！人类，你好呀~我就是多朗马尔先生，嘎嘎嘎~"
