      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We are sent to here to take you to the heaven of cats, ^A2314BMalangdo^000000.",
      "translation" : "我们被派到这里，是为了带你去猫的天堂——^A2314B绵绵岛^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How is that? The crowded city of Prontera is good, but why don't you go our heaven of the cats, ^A2314BMalangdo^000000?",
      "translation" : "怎么样？人来人往的普隆德拉固然不错，但要不要去我们猫的天堂——^A2314B绵绵岛^000000看看？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you go to ^A2314BMalangdo^000000? That place is better than Geffen, where there are only crowds of simple honest wizards.",
      "translation" : "要不要去^A2314B绵绵岛^000000看看？那里可比吉芬好多了，吉芬满大街都是老实巴交的巫师。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The fresh air of Payon is not bad, but why don't you go better place like the heaven of the cats, ^A2314BMalangdo^000000?",
      "translation" : "斐扬的空气固然清新，但要不要去更好的地方——猫的天堂^A2314B绵绵岛^000000看看？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@s$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}The beautiful and quiet place is better than Aldebaran, where it's so noisy with the tick-tock sound of the clock.",
      "translation" : "{0}那个美丽宁静的地方，可比整天滴答滴答响个不停的艾尔帕兰好多了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@s$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}The beautiful and quiet place is better than Morocc, with its heat and sandstorms.",
      "translation" : "{0}那个美丽宁静的地方，可比又热又刮沙尘暴的梦罗克好多了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@s$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}The beautiful place is better than Juno, which is full of books and headaches.",
      "translation" : "{0}那个美丽的地方，可比满是书本、让人头疼的朱诺好多了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@s$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}The complex place is better than Rachel, where it's too horribly quiet.",
      "translation" : "{0}那个热闹的地方，可比安静得吓人的拉赫好多了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@s$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}The safe place is better than Lighthalzen, which is too dangerous.",
      "translation" : "{0}那个安全的地方，可比危险的里希塔乐镇好多了。"
    },
    {
