      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@s$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}The smell of this sea place is better than Mora, which is full of a grassy smell.",
      "translation" : "{0}这里的海洋气息，可比满是青草味的穆拉好多了。"
