      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Anyway, I got you. Just tell me whenever you want to go.",
      "translation" : "行吧，我知道了。想去的时候告诉我就行。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Uh? You must be the one from last time...? Alright. Did you visit ^A2314BMalangdo^000000?",
      "translation" : "嗯？你是上次来的那位吗...?好吧。你去过^A2314B绵绵岛^000000了吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Take me to ^A2314BMalangdo^000000 again",
      "translation" : "再带我去一次^A2314B绵绵岛^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I have visited",
      "translation" : "我去过了"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I really want to send you there, but I can't because of the policy. It is difficult to send people who have visited ^A2314BMalangdo^000000 already.",
      "translation" : "我很想送你过去，但规定不允许。已经去过^A2314B绵绵岛^000000的人，我很难再送过去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And that was roughly it... It's supposed to be rule 53...",
      "translation" : "大概就是这么回事...应该是第53条规矩..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Actually, let me tell you rule 53. I am an indulgent cat.",
      "translation" : "其实，我来告诉你第53条规矩吧。我是一只宽容的猫。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you want to go back to ^A2314BMalangdo^000000, take the ship at Izlude or Alberta.",
      "translation" : "想回^A2314B绵绵岛^000000的话，就在依斯鲁得或阿尔贝塔搭船。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you enjoy that pleasant sea trip, you will arrive at the heaven of cats, ^A2314BMalangdo^000000.",
      "translation" : "享受一段愉快的海上旅程后，你就会抵达猫咪的天堂——^A2314B绵绵岛^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So easy! Isn't it? Well, good bye~",
      "translation" : "很简单吧？那么，再见啦~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How was it? You liked it? I knew it. Kakaka~",
      "translation" : "感觉怎么样？喜欢吗？我就知道，嘎嘎嘎~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Dolangmal",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dolangmal]",
      "translation" : "[多朗马尔]"
    },
